  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "BIM建築生命週期管理與應用",
    "sub_ename": "BIM PARAMETERS AND INFORMATION MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要目的是讓學生了解BIM有關於物件導向參數模型、以及進一步執行與管理參數元件與資料。透過個案深入研究與操作，學生將會熟悉BIM系統的整合與應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will guide students in exploring the potential of parametric object-oriented modeling, as well as the importance of attaching and managing information with respect to parametric objects.  The building design, construction, and operation industry is being radically impacted — even transformed — by the process changes that have become possible because of parametric, information-rich modeling.  Students will be exposed to the breadth of parameter and information management in BIM, and will be given the opportunity to explore a selected application in depth.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
